# Datasets and model artifacts are not committed.
#
# Raw datasets: licence terms may forbid redistribution, and a corpus of
# personal accounts of harassment should not be duplicated into a git history
# where it cannot be deleted.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/README.md

# Trained models and vectorisers — regenerable from `python -m ml.src.evaluate`,
# and a fine-tuned transformer is hundreds of megabytes.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep

# Results ARE committed: they are the deliverable, and a diff on them is how a
# regression in the pipeline becomes visible.
!results/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
